@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083

### Filter a text: prohibited words become asterisks
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profanity/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "What a darn good day, no heck at all!"
}

### List the prohibited words
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/words

### Add a word
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/words
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "gloomy"
}

### Remove a word
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/words/gloomy
